{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 64225, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 48002, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "暗WB预攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1608379068, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1610057260, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 94, "status": 1, "summary": "1.8更新：为防止误导，删除了点火相关中错误的内容。1.1更新：①生存问题。这次boss伤害确实很高，而且ss优先最低血加上高系数的增益暴发，可以说是苦不堪言。关于生存问题，能少上就少上。接下来是我认", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1609402171690_23881540.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 22, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 25594, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 64225, "content": "<div>1.8更新：为防止误导，删除了点火相关中错误的内容。<br></div><div>1.1更新：</div><div>①生存问题。这次boss伤害确实很高，而且ss优先最低血加上高系数的增益暴发，可以说是苦不堪言。关于生存问题，能少上就少上。接下来是我认为比较好的解决办法。首选的是狗哥，因为狗哥兼具减速和退ds量表，除了增强我方的保护能力外，削弱敌方技能频率也是一种思路。与狗哥类似的是各种可以减速的天子，如罗密欧、木糖猫等，但没有退ds量表都没狗哥好用。本人情况：前排全六星，+6复活奶和+3狗哥即可保证前排安全，偶尔会死一个。降攻手段目前没有好用的天子，可以自行选择。在上了埃及猫（ts含失明）的前提下，再上一个暗妲比也只能降低增益爆发的几率。如果上狗哥的情况下再抗不住上个水炮（全体加屏障）或四星勒达（全体加持续治疗量）或史莱姆王（全体加防、优于教皇）应该就没问题了。大多数死人是因为复活奶的回血被爆掉了。为了生存上三个天子（狗哥、复活奶、X）还保不住可能是前排没全部六星。</div><div>②ss伤害。大概率对于点火后的ss伤害公式有误，等待进一步测试。<br></div><div><br></div><div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、活动简介</span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">此攻略为不考虑使用水属性队伍而用克制boss的光属性天子组队！四星点火推迟，难受。</span></span></span></span><br></div><div>12.31将开启暗WB，技能如下。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1609402171690_23881540.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1609402171690_23881540.jpg\"></div></span><br></div></span><span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">难点分析：不论是ts的分解还是ss的增益爆发，其实都是小问题。麻烦的是boss给自己加攻加速还有ds的减益回避率。家人们，建议使用狗哥来阻止boss扔出ds，或是使用木糖猫的诱惑来无效化boss的buff。</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div><div><br></div><div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">二、对策天子<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">猜测正确。双对策，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">绚烂亚里亚</span></span>为百分比ss三连刀，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">黎明萨图恩</span>为光双刃。技能及立绘见官方公告。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></span></div><div>强度评价：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">绚烂亚里亚为百分比刀，而</span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">百分比刀的强度要等公式，所以不好说。黎明萨图恩为光双刃，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">光双刃的强度不必赘述<span>，顺便提醒一下，光双刃大概率是：无点火下随机光5体双刃剑，3红变最高攻光5体双刃剑，强烈建议3红。</span></span></span></span><br></div><div>抽卡建议：从性价比考虑，光双刃建议抽满p，绚烂亚里亚建议抽+0挂在队伍里吃加成。这次偶像五人组全员live2d的制作都很精良，也可遵从感性多抽几个。</div><div><br><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">三、组队推荐</span><br></p></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.必上天子</span><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608374726169_88612164.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608374726169_88612164.png\"></div></span></span><span><div class=\"div-img\">糖猫、光月月、鲜花最好是3红。鲜花没有3红就不是必上。<br></div></span></div><div><span><div class=\"div-img\">建议只上两把刀。主要是因为由于点火前后刀的输出差距太大，而且第三把刀本身能吃到的buff不多，和两把主刀比起来差太多。未知的加成天子属于必上。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1.1 技能预约</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">鲸鱼：在装备“夏日饕餮”魂卡的情况下，T S S S S ，否则 S 。<br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">光月月：如果只有ss刀，不论光月月是3红还是6红，都设置 S ；如果有ts刀有ss刀，3红光月月 S ，6红光月月 T S ；如果只有ts刀，3红光月月 T ，6红光月月 T S 。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">木莫娜：待定。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">露娜：待定。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">其余天子：S 。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1.2 刀卡推荐</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span></span></span></span>以下关于点火的内容均基于日服，国际服数据以实装为准。注意ts刀是一定要做主刀的，没有攻击力buff很菜。</div><div class=\"div-img\">①埃及猫：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">ts四连。</span></span>由于不需要技能变化，点几红都是可以的，微氪零氪的首选刀，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"></span>推荐点火</span></span>；</div><div class=\"div-img\">②普巴：<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">无点火ss四连；<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">6红后ss六连。</span></span>其实不点火也是很强的，但是能6红还是6红，而且普巴PVP也很强，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">推荐点火</span></span>；</div><div class=\"div-img\">③光弗雷：无点火ss四连；<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">6红后还是ss四连。</span></span>考虑到长期收益，不推荐点火，但是要用的话可以点火；</div><div class=\"div-img\">④光土星、夏洛特：无点火ts三连；<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">6红后依然是ts三连，但是同时也是ss四连。</span></span>在做主刀的时候，常规的ts三连比常规的ss四连强一点。光土星本身PVP就很强，夏洛特6红后PVP也可以用，这两个要用的话可以点火。</div><div class=\"div-img\">⑤婚巴：婚巴情况比较特殊。国际服和日服婚巴的原始技能就不同，而且日服婚巴原始技能为ss二连，5红后变为ss三连。如果国际服照搬日服点火，那么婚巴6红后依然是ss三连。但是，国际服婚巴就应该是6红变ss四连的。婚巴本身WB并不厉害，Raid比较厉害。如果考虑性价比，并且6红后是ss四连，可以点火。</div><div class=\"div-img\">⑥光女警、光提裙：比较菜，不建议使用，也不建议点火。</div><div class=\"div-img\">⑦艳后：Raid刀，ss二连，6红后ss三连，WB用还是算了吧。</div><div class=\"div-img\">⑧亚里亚：对策刀卡，百分比ss三连，强度暂时不明。<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2.补位天子<span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608646904817_57190217.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608646904817_57190217.png\"></div></span><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span></span>3.下位替换<br></div></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span></span></span><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\">泡面可使用四星的吉他妹代替；低加木伞可以同时带上四星的火镰刀；低加木基佬可使用四星的跳窗代替。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">技能预约：S 。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div></span><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">四、前后排站位</span><br></p></div></span><br></div></span>boss没有控制，练度高的氪佬随意站位。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">如果无法保证生存，请优先满足以下条件：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">①光属性放后排；</div><div class=\"div-img\">②六星天子放前排。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">五、攻击力调整</span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">强烈建议3红土星。3红光双刃下可以不做任何调整，至于哪些天子吃双刃待定。因为这还涉及到糖猫五体ss-2s的buff的问题，所以仅仅是可以不调整，<span><span>在3红糖猫和3红土星下，必须在光天子压攻击力的同时，木伞木人鱼全力堆攻击力才能抢到后排前五攻，从而稳定吃到ss-2s的buff</span></span>；如果没有3红光双刃，需要把刀以外的光天子攻击力尽量压低，压到多低可以自行计算，这样做也会有问题，如果带了复活奶，复活奶的奶量会大打折扣。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">六、魂卡推荐</span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">攻击型天子：</span>首选“满月露娜”以及新魂卡“定装”（“定装”为暴击时触发），次选“海岸女神”或是其他棱镜+5攻暴魂卡。<span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">如果使用棱镜+5的“满月露娜”或者新魂卡“定装”，这两张魂卡的特效可以将触发该特效之前的伤害直接乘上1.22！（武器2号位附魔伤害过低忽略不计）</span></span><span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">鲸鱼：</span>有“夏日饕餮”就带上，记得改技能预约。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">前排天子：</span>首选“表演的时候到了”（如果boss有减益）、“禁忌的果实”（如果带了复活奶），次选其他的血防魂卡。血防魂卡数量不够优先属性里有血量的魂卡。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">其余天子：</span>按攻击力调整配置即可。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">七、ds顺序及leader</span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span>ds顺序建议光月月——木人鱼——光双刃。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span>leader推荐宋丹丹或者狗姐。强力附魔的氪佬可以另行测试，绚烂亚里亚的leaderbuff看上去就很强力。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">八、点火相关</span><br></p></div></span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1.点火推荐</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span>优先点糖猫和光月月，至少点到3红；除此以外，鲜花也非常值得3红，但是不必强求；<span style=\"text-decoration: line-through;\">四星的飞刀哥点火性价比也很高，在boss防御力依旧为2400的情况下，3红飞刀哥可以提升大约14%的总伤害；四星的肉球，6红后可以为ts刀提升大约10%的总伤害（与飞刀哥的14%乘算）。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2.额外增伤</span></span>（不包含点火）<br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span>首先要明确一点，对于ts刀和ss刀来说，额外增伤是不完全相同的，以下会对本次WB的额外增伤进行计算。其中，涉及到的天子均为+6，光月月为3红。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span>相同部分：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><span><p>木莫娜15%+木人鱼30%+泡面67.3%+木基佬41.8%+露娜50%+火莫娜15.4%+光莫娜50.4%<span><span><span><span><span>+战场buff40%</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>=309.9%</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>不同部分：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>①ss刀为光月月83.7%；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>②ts刀为光月月46.8%。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">额外增伤：ss刀 393.6%；ts刀 356.7%。<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">在计算时额外增伤再加100%之后，乘上其他部分。</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3.点火效果简述</span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>红攻</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>提升黄字攻击</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>力、绿字攻击力、以及攻击力buff的收益，非常强。注意红攻不提供攻击力，只提升收益。</span></span></span></span></p><p>红暴：提升暴击伤害，算在额外增伤里。</p><p>红敏：提升弱点最终伤害，算在额外增伤里。</p><p>红防：提升防御力收益，同红攻。</p><p>白血、白攻、白防、白暴、白敏：提供对应的绿字属性，白血为3000，其余为1500。<br><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">4.<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">国际服点火核心</span></span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></span></p></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span>感谢<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">不再年轻了</span></span>的数据测试，以下内容均基于伤害计算公式得到。<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/52136.html\" target=\"_blank\">公式点这里。</a></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span>首先国际服对于点火相比于日服是有改动的，具体如下：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span>①红攻改动未知，疑似对ts削弱，对ss增强。<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">仅仅是可能性，目前没有具体数据证明。</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span>②红暴加强，每100红暴从10%暴击伤害增至30%；</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span>③红敏加强，每100红敏从5%弱点最终伤害增至20%。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><span></span></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">红暴红敏的暴伤和弱点最终伤害与前述的额外增伤是加算，但是副属性为双红暴下，高达180%的额外增伤也非常厉害！</span></span><br></div></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><span><span></span></span></span></div></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1609402171690_23881540.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 194, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 99017156, "content_num": 1065, "read_num": 2013197, "like_num": 1043}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "t